---
title: "JRN-001 Happy Path — Personal Current Account Opening"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor PER001 as PER-001<br/>Personal Customer
    participant Channel as Channel<br/>Web/Mobile Portal (CAP-007)
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API<br/>Retail Banking
    participant CAP005 as CAP-005 API<br/>Compliance
    participant EB as Event Bus<br/>SVC-102

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over PER001,CAP001: PH-001 — Application Initiation
        PER001->>Channel: Submit application form<br/>(name, DOB, address, nationality, account type)
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /applications<br/>{ account_type: standard_current, channel: mobile_app,<br/>applicant: { first_name: Amara, last_name: Okonkwo,<br/>date_of_birth: 1992-07-15, nationality: [GB],<br/>address: 14 Thornfield Road, Manchester, M14 7PJ } }
        Note over CAP001: Create ENT-007 ApplicationRecord (status: in_progress)<br/>Create ENT-001 Customer prospect<br/>application_ref: PCA-2026-00042
        CAP001->>EB: Publish ApplicationStarted<br/>{ application_id, customer_id, channel: mobile_app, started_at }
        CAP001-->>Channel: 201 Created { application_id, application_ref: PCA-2026-00042, status: in_progress }
        Channel-->>PER001: Confirmation screen + application reference
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over PER001,CAP005: PH-002 — Identity Verification
        Channel->>CAP005: POST /identity-verifications<br/>{ application_id, document_type: passport,<br/>customer_name: Amara Okonkwo, DOB: 1992-07-15,<br/>address: 14 Thornfield Road, Manchester }
        Note over CAP005: Create ENT-002 IdentityVerification (status: pending)<br/>Return vendor SDK token (Onfido)
        CAP005-->>Channel: 201 Created { verification_id, vendor_sdk_token }
        Channel-->>PER001: Display Onfido SDK (document capture + liveness check)
        PER001->>CAP005: Onfido SDK completes — vendor webhook<br/>{ outcome: pass, biometric_match_score: 0.96, address_verification: confirmed }
        Note over CAP005: Persist ENT-002 IdentityVerification (status: pass)<br/>Biometric template NOT stored — outcome only (UK GDPR Art.9)
        CAP005->>EB: Publish IdentityVerificationCompleted<br/>{ verification_id, customer_id, document_type: passport, outcome: PASS }
        Channel-->>PER001: In-app: "Identity confirmed — background checks in progress"
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        Note over EB,CAP005: PH-003 — KYC/CDD Assessment
        EB-)CAP005: Consume IdentityVerificationCompleted → initiate CDD
        Note over CAP005: Internal: sanctions screen (OFSI, OFAC, UN, EU) — <3,000ms SLA<br/>Result: CLEAR (processing_time_ms: 312)<br/>PEP screening — ComplyAdvantage: CLEAR<br/>Adverse media screening: CLEAR<br/>Risk scoring: 22/100 → risk_category: simplified
        Note over CAP005: Create ENT-003 KycAssessment (status: cleared)<br/>risk_category: simplified | next_review_date: +5yr
        CAP005->>EB: Publish KYCClearanceGranted<br/>{ assessment_id, customer_id, risk_category: simplified,<br/>next_review_date: 2031-04-15 }
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over EB,CAP001: PH-004 — Account Decision
        EB-)CAP001: Consume KYCClearanceGranted
        Note over CAP001: Decision engine: identity PASS + KYC CLEAR<br/>+ risk simplified + age 18+ + UK resident → APPROVED<br/>Update ENT-007 ApplicationRecord (decision: APPROVED)
        CAP001->>EB: Publish ApplicationDecisionMade<br/>{ application_id, customer_id, decision_outcome: APPROVED, decided_at }
        Note over EB: Route to Notifications (SVC-053):<br/>In-app + Email: "Application approved — setting up your account"
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over CAP001,EB: PH-005 — Account Provisioning
        Note over CAP001: Create ENT-004 Account:<br/>sort_code: 40-47-84<br/>account_number: 87654321<br/>balance: £0.00<br/>FSCS SCV updated<br/>Create ENT-005 CardIssuance (delivery: 3–5 working days)<br/>PCI DSS: no PAN or CVV2 in event payload
        CAP001->>EB: Publish AccountOpened<br/>{ account_id, customer_id, sort_code: 40-47-84,<br/>account_number: 87654321, iban, fscs_eligible: true }
        CAP001->>EB: Publish AccountProvisioned<br/>{ account_id, customer_id, status: active,<br/>cass_registered: false, provisioned_at }
        CAP001->>EB: Publish CardIssuanceTriggered<br/>{ card_id, account_id, card_type: debit, delivery_address }
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 245)
        Note over PER001,CAP001: PH-006 — Digital Channel Activation
        PER001->>Channel: Set up credentials (username + password)
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /customers/{id}/credentials + register FIDO2/WebAuthn device<br/>{ customer_id, hashed_password, fido2_credential_id, device_id }
        Note over CAP001: Credential created; FIDO2 device registered<br/>Biometric assertion only — template stays on device<br/>(FIDO2/WebAuthn + UK GDPR data minimisation)
        PER001->>Channel: First login — SCA (Face ID + registered device)
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /auth/verify-sca { fido2_assertion, customer_id }
        CAP001-->>Channel: SCA confirmed
        CAP001->>EB: Publish DigitalChannelActivated<br/>{ customer_id, account_id, sca_enrolled: true, activated_at }
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 220)
        Note over PER001,Channel: PH-007 — Welcome and Onboarding
        Note over EB: Route AccountOpened/DigitalChannelActivated → Notifications (SVC-053):<br/>Welcome email: account details, sort code, FSCS info sheet<br/>In-app: initial funding prompt + CASS switching option<br/>+ vulnerability wellbeing questions (FCA FG21/1)
        CAP001->>EB: Publish WelcomePackDispatched<br/>{ customer_id, account_id, dispatched_at }
        Note over PER001: Journey complete — customer is active account holder<br/>Total elapsed: <10 minutes (automated path)
    end
